<title>NEW ZEALAND: Lion Nathan says S&amp;P affirms BB+/B credit ratings.</title>
<headline>Lion Nathan says S&amp;P affirms BB+/B credit ratings.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australasian brewer Lion Nathan said on Monday that Standard and Poor's had affirmed its long term debt rating at BB+ and its short term rating at B.</p>
<p>Lion said these ratings were established almost three years ago when Standard and Poor's last reviewed the company's credit ratings in June, 1994.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
